# Everything here is optional: without it the game still runs, reading the
# S&P 500 history straight from Yahoo Finance (fine for local dev).

# Vercel Blob store that keeps the S&P 500 history. Connect a public store to
# the project (`vercel blob create-store stonksville --access public`, then
# link it) and this lands in the environment on its own. The first request to
# /api/spx seeds the store; the daily cron keeps it fresh.
BLOB_READ_WRITE_TOKEN=""

# Guards /api/cron/spx. Vercel Cron sends it as a bearer token when set on the
# project. Trigger a refresh by hand with:
#   curl -H "Authorization: Bearer $CRON_SECRET" https://<host>/api/cron/spx
CRON_SECRET=""
